  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/IMG_4280.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>200 fotos del primer d&iacute;a de apertura de la piscina de verano de Onda, este domingo, tras la entrega de diplomas de los cursillos desarrollados durante la remporada en la piscina cubierta. Ha habido actividades a cargo de Sargantana Aventura, como piraguas, una lancha o tiro con arco.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4254.jpg\" alt=\"img_4254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4255.jpg\" alt=\"img_4255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4256.jpg\" alt=\"img_4256\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4257.jpg\" alt=\"img_4257\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4259.jpg\" alt=\"img_4259\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4260.jpg\" alt=\"img_4260\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4261.jpg\" alt=\"img_4261\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4262.jpg\" alt=\"img_4262\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diplomespiscinaestiuonda/img_4263.jpg\" alt=\"img_4263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"ht